Gemini Jets FedEx B777-200LRF Revised Livery N895FD GJFDX2304 1:400
&nbsp;
The aircraft's left wing had broken off and was repaired with minimal signs of previous damage and there is a bent antenna on top of the fuselage as shown in the photos above.

NG Models KLM Royal Dutch Airlines 777-300ER OrangePride cs PH-BVA 73041 1:400
&nbsp;
Repaired the left landing gear, right landing gear, left wing, and left horizontal stabilizer. Minimal signs of repairs as shown in the photos above.

NG Models Lufthansa 747-8 D-ABYT 78016 1:400
&nbsp;
Small paint blemish just under the nose of the airplane as shown in the images.
&nbsp;

Gemini200 United Airlines B727-100 Saul Bass livery N7001U G2UAL948 1:200
&nbsp;
The right wing had broken off and was repaired however upon closer inspection you may see that it does not perfectly mirror the other side of the aircraft.

NG Models Atlas Air 747-8F N863GT (the last 747 ever built; bare metal colors) 78012 1:400
(ULTIMATE COLLECTION)&nbsp;
One of the landing gear had broken off but was repaired. Visibly there is no sign of damage as shown in the photos.

Gemini Jets ITA Airways A330-900neo EI=HJN GJITY2217 1:400
&nbsp;
The left horizontal stabilizer was broken off and repaired.&nbsp;

Gemini Jets Alaska Airlines B737-800S N559AS &rdquo;Salmon People&rdquo; GJASA2213 Scale 1:400
&nbsp;
The left wing was broken off and repaired with minimal signs of previous damage as shown in the photos above. The front landing gear was also broken off and repaired but was installed backwards by accident as shown in the photos above.

Gemini200 Delta Air Lines A321neo N589DT "100 Years" G2DAL1399 Scale 1:200
&nbsp;
The front landing gear is slightly bent and loose as shown in photos.

Gemini Jets Air New Zealand A321neo "Star Alliance" livery ZK-OYB GJANZ2178 1:400
&nbsp;
The aircraft is missing a antenna on the top of the fuselage and the left and right landing gear along with the left and right engines were broken off and repaired with little to no signs of previous damage as shown in the photos above.&nbsp;

Gemini Jets Hawaiian Airlines B787-9 N780HA GJHAL2047 1:400
&nbsp;
There is a small rip in the packaging and the right wingtip is bent downwards and the right horizontal stabilizer was broken off and repaired.

JC Wings&nbsp;Virgin Orbit B747-400 N744VG with Wing-mounted Rocket JC4VIR0036 1:400&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Repaired the left horizontal and vertical stabilizer, repaired the rocket holder, paint smudge on the rocket, and damage to the box.

Gemini Jets Lufthansa B787-9 D-ABPU "100 anniversary livery" GJDLH2399 Scale 1:400
&nbsp;
Part of the aircraft's tail has broken off as shown in photos. The broken piece will be included in your order.

Gemini200 JetBlue Airways E190-100IGW "Only Blue" N323JB G2JBU1335 Scale 1:200
&nbsp;
Missing antenna towards the front of the fuselage as shown in the images above.

Phoenix Models Lufthansa Boeing 747-8i intercontinental Old Livery D-ABYU PH04529 1:400
&nbsp;
Paint blemish on the front / cockpit of the plane as shown in the images.

Gemini Jets Alaska Airlines B737-800S N559AS &rdquo;Salmon People&rdquo; (upgrade stand) RESTOCK GJASA2213 Scale 1:400
&nbsp;
The left wing was broken off and repaired however there is some paint chipping around the base of the wing as shown in the photos.

Gemini200 Qantas Airways B747-200B(M) "City of Swan Hill," 1980s livery VH-ECB G2QFA554 1:200
&nbsp;
The tail and left wing broke off and were repaired.
